        <p>BROCKLEHURST.—On the 14th 'lnst., at Moss House, Whitefield-road, Stockton Heath, Esther, widow of the late Thomas Brocklehurst, in her 81st year. MATHER.—january 10th, at 131, Orford-lane, Esther Mather, aged 67 years. MASSEY.—January Bth, at 93, Birchall-street,</p>
        <p>Ellen Massey, aged 75 years. BAKER.—January 10th, at 99, Catherine-street, Albert Charles Baker, aged 43 years. HERON.—January 13th, at 34, Norris-street, Betsy Heron, aged 74 years. In Memoriam. HASSALL.—In ever-loving memory of our dear son, Sam Hassall, who died 15th January, 1913. Not dead to us that loved him, Not lost, but gone before; He lives with us in memory still, And will for evermore. FATHER, MOTHER. SISTERS &amp; BROTHER.</p>
