        <p>ANNUAL MEETING.</p>
        <p>The annual general meeting will take place at headquarters (Gladstone Arms) on Thursday, January 28th, at 7.30 p.m. List of set-board prizes and specials taken from weighing-in book, kept at headquarters, and slips received by secretary. Should any member find his name omitted from this list, please communicate with the secretary at once. A.S.</p>
